-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Interoperability note
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

This layer reproduces the *names, signatures and documented behaviour* of a
subset of the Win32 API (CreateIoCompletionPort, GetQueuedCompletionStatus,
OVERLAPPED, CreateFileW, WSA*, AcceptEx/ConnectEx, DCB/SetCommState, the SCM
entry points, and the MFC/ATL surface the two libraries use) so that
unmodified legacy sources compile against POSIX. It is an independent
implementation written for interoperability. No Microsoft source, header or
sample code is included in, or was copied into, this repository.

On _WIN32 nothing here is used: every header includes the genuine Microsoft
header and defines nothing else.


